"<h2>魚箱（{1}/{2}）</h2><p style=\"color:var(--sub);font-size:.8rem;margin:0 0 8px\">大きい魚（★が多い魚）ほど高く売れます。</p>\n    <button class=\"big\" id=\"sellall\" {3}>すべて売る {4}</button>{5}{6}{7}{8}{9}\n    <div class=\"card\" style=\"margin:10px 0 0;font-size:.82rem\"><b>売値ボーナス</b>\n      <div class=\"kv\" style=\"margin-top:6px\"><span>直売所 Lv{10}（自宅・設備タブで強化）</span><b class=\"num\">+{11}%</b><span>ランク特典</span><b class=\"num\">+{12}%</b>{13}<span>エリアコンプ（そのエリアの魚のみ）</span><b class=\"num\">+5%／エリア</b></div>\n      <div style=\"color:var(--sub);margin-top:6px\">このほか、魚の大きさ・鮮度・今日の相場でも値段が変わります。</div></div>\n    <div class=\"list\" style=\"margin-top:10px\">{14}</div>\n    {15}\n    <h2>今日の相場</h2><p style=\"color:var(--sub);font-size:.78rem;margin:0 0 6px;{16}\">{17}の旬の魚（<span class=\"tag\" style=\"background:var(--good)\">旬</span>）は、よく釣れて売値も+{18}%です。</p><div>{19}</div>":"<h2>Cooler ({1}/{2})</h2><p style=\"color:var(--sub);font-size:.8rem;margin:0 0 8px\">Bigger fish (more ★) sell for more.</p>\n    <button class=\"big\" id=\"sellall\" {3}>Sell All {4}</button>{5}{6}{7}{8}{9}\n    <div class=\"card\" style=\"margin:10px 0 0;font-size:.82rem\"><b>Sale price bonuses</b>\n      <div class=\"kv\" style=\"margin-top:6px\"><span>Fish Stand Lv{10} (upgrade in Home & Gear)</span><b class=\"num\">+{11}%</b><span>Rank perk</span><b class=\"num\">+{12}%</b>{13}<span>Waters Complete (that Waters' fish only)</span><b class=\"num\">+5%/area</b></div>\n      <div style=\"color:var(--sub);margin-top:6px\">Fish size, freshness, and today's market price also affect the price.</div></div>\n    <div class=\"list\" style=\"margin-top:10px\">{14}</div>\n    {15}\n    <h2>Today's Market Prices</h2><p style=\"color:var(--sub);font-size:.78rem;margin:0 0 6px;{16}\">Fish in season during {17} (<span class=\"tag\" style=\"background:var(--good)\">In season</span>) bite more often and sell for {18}% more.</p><div>{19}</div>",
