"<div class=\"item\"><div class=\"t\">従業員を雇う <span class=\"num\">{1}/{2}人</span></div>\n    <button class=\"buy\" data-crew=\"1\" {3}>{4}</button>\n    <div class=\"s\">{5}<br>働いた日数でレベルが上がり、水揚げも給料も増えます。一人ひとりに<b>特性</b>があります（釣り上手・商売上手・勤勉・倹約家・のんびり屋・ふつう）。給料の基本は{6}/日。雇える人数は自宅を大きくすると増えます（今は{7}人まで）。</div>\n    {8}</div>\n    {9}\n    {10}":"<div class=\"item\"><div class=\"t\">Hire Crew <span class=\"num\">{1}/{2}</span></div>\n    <button class=\"buy\" data-crew=\"1\" {3}>{4}</button>\n    <div class=\"s\">{5}<br>Crew level up with the days they work, boosting both their haul and their wage. Each one has a <b>Trait</b> (Skilled Angler, Savvy Seller, Hard Worker, Thrifty, Easygoing, Normal). Base wage is {6}/day. Enlarge your home to hire more (max {7} for now).</div>\n    {8}</div>\n    {9}\n    {10}",
