"    <h2>ライバル漁師（週間売上）</h2><div class=\"card\"><div class=\"kv\" style=\"font-size:.84rem\">{1}</div>\n      <div style=\"color:var(--sub);font-size:.78rem;margin-top:6px\">毎週、1週間の収入（売上・水揚げ・賞金など）で競います。次の発表は {2}日目の夜。入賞でBPと評判、1位はおまかせ釣り券もらえます。{3}　通算の1位：{4}回</div></div>":"    <h2>Rival Anglers (Weekly Sales)</h2><div class=\"card\"><div class=\"kv\" style=\"font-size:.84rem\">{1}</div>\n      <div style=\"color:var(--sub);font-size:.78rem;margin-top:6px\">You compete every week on your income (sales, hauls, prize money, etc.). Next results: the night of Day {2}. Placing earns BP and Reputation, and 1st place also gets an Auto-Fish Ticket.{3} Total 1st-place finishes: {4}</div></div>",
"<div><b>参加中！</b> 今日の最高の一匹：<b class=\"num\">{1}</b>{2}<div style=\"color:var(--sub);font-size:.8rem;margin-top:4px\">夜にランキングが発表されます。高く売れる魚を釣ろう（おまかせ釣りは対象外・主は除く）。</div></div>":"<div><b>You're in!</b> Today's best catch: <b class=\"num\">{1}</b>{2}<div style=\"color:var(--sub);font-size:.8rem;margin-top:4px\">Rankings are announced tonight. Go for fish that sell high (Auto Fishing doesn't count; Bosses are excluded).</div></div>",
