"    <h2>釣り大会</h2><div class=\"card\">{1}\n      <div class=\"kv\" style=\"margin-top:6px;font-size:.82rem\"><span>賞金 1位／2位／3位</span><b class=\"num\">{2}／{3}／{4}</b>{5}<span>通算</span><b class=\"num\">{6}回出場・優勝{7}回</b></div>\n      <div style=\"color:var(--sub);font-size:.78rem;margin-top:6px\">7日ごとに開催。参加すると、その日に自分で釣った魚のうち、いちばん高い1匹でライバル5人と競います。</div></div>":"    <h2>Fishing Tournament</h2><div class=\"card\">{1}\n      <div class=\"kv\" style=\"margin-top:6px;font-size:.82rem\"><span>Prizes 1st / 2nd / 3rd</span><b class=\"num\">{2} / {3} / {4}</b>{5}<span>Overall</span><b class=\"num\">Entered: {6} · Won: {7}</b></div>\n      <div style=\"color:var(--sub);font-size:.78rem;margin-top:6px\">Held every 7 days. If you enter, the most valuable fish you personally catch that day goes up against 5 rival anglers.</div></div>",
